  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Compact Waveshare development board based on Raspberry Pi RP2350A, with USB Type-C, castellated PCB edges, an RGB LED, 520KB SRAM, and 4MB board Flash. The RP2350A offers selectable dual-core Arm Cortex-M33 or Hazard3 RISC-V processor architectures.\n\nThe official CAD ZIP contains RP2350-Zero.step. A board revision and pre-soldered-header compatibility are not specified, so this is a mechanical reference without an inferred current storefront SKU or sales offer. This is distinct from RP2350-Zero-CM, RP2350-One, and RP2350-Plus."
    }
  ],
